-- MAGIC             <strong style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 1.1em;">Key Considerations</strong>
-- MAGIC             <ul>
-- MAGIC               <li>Allows phased migration or indefinite coexistence.</li>
-- MAGIC               <li>Requires planning for eventual “hard migration” for legacy retirement.</li>
-- MAGIC               <li>Minimizes code and data movement at the outset; eventual migration still necessary for full UC benefits.</li>
-- MAGIC               <li>Best for organizations seeking low-disruption, hybrid adoption, and incremental migration. It also helps customers who need immediate UC features for new projects but aren't ready for full migration.</li>
