-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ### C1. Overall Process
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC 1. Configure HMS federation (read/write for internal HMS, read-only for external HMS/Glue).
-- MAGIC 1. UC automatically applies governance controls (ACLs, lineage, search) to federated tables.
-- MAGIC 1. New use cases can start on UC immediately while legacy workloads continue using HMS.

-- COMMAND ----------

-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ## D. Recap
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC All approaches can leverage automation (UCX toolkit), migration scripts, and post-cutover validation trackers. HMS Federation can both accelerate access to UC features and provide a practical migration bridge, but customers aiming to retire HMS should plan for subsequent full migration (“hard migration”). 
